// in ~/workspace/your_files/species-characteristics/ — living species
// of Animalia, Plantae and Fungi, up to 8 per class, best-recorded
// first. Nothing here is invented: every name, class, order, family,
// environment and size comes from the datasets; where the dataset
// holds no length the entry says sizeSource 'class-default', and
// where the environment is inferred from the water-body column (no
// water body recorded = not aquatic) it says envSource 'inferred'.
// Rebuild deterministically with ~/workspace/earth4/build-catalogue.py.
//
// Fields: name (scientific), kingdom, class, order, family,
// env (terrestrial | freshwater | marine | amphibious — the spawn
// rule: terrestrial spawns on land, freshwater/marine in water,
// amphibious on either), realm (first recorded biogeographic realm,
// '' when the dataset lists none), sizeM (metres), diet, habitat
// ('' when not recorded).
